WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.280
Bartimos Celtigar: Your cause owns a power&nbsp;
that has not been seen in this world since&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:11.440
the days of Old Valyria. Dragons. 
Daemon Targaryen: We have Syrax, Caraxes and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:14.400
Meleys. Baela has Moondancer. 
Rhaenyra Targaryen: Daemon,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.040
none of our dragons have been to war.
Daemon Targaryen: There are also unclaimed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:21.760
dragons. Seasmoke still resides on Driftmark.&nbsp;
Vermithor and Silverwing dwell on the Dragonmont,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:27.460
still riderless. Then there are the three&nbsp;
wild dragons, all of whom nest here. 
&nbsp;

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:28.600
Rhaenyra Targaryen: And&nbsp;
who is to ride them?
&nbsp;

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:30.391
Daemon Targaryen: Dragonstone&nbsp;
has 13 to their 4.
&nbsp;

00:00:30.391 --> 00:00:45.160
Bartimos Celtigar: There has never lived a&nbsp;
Stark who forgot an oath. And with House Stark,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:48.040
the North will follow.
Daemon Targaryen: We have no&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:57.800
friends among the Lannisters.
Borros Baratheon: The House of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.800 --> 00:00:59.920
Dragon does not seem to know who rules it. 

